{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And I:</b> The sense is: how could you turn back to kiss a calf that does not save and does not satisfy, while you set aside your Elohim from ancient days, who saved you and knew all your needs, in the manner of 'a knowing righteous one' [יודע צדיק]."], :book :hosea, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {0 "The phrase כדרך יודע צדיק is opaque; rendered hyper-literally. It may echo a fixed expression or be textually uncertain."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Hosea -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=15&perek=1&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:51:06.722567548Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}